wudi-m-o085-wudi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o085"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p064-wudi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p064"]},{"id":"wendi-m-o004-wudi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o004"]},{"id":"wendi-m-o053-wudi-p0028","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o053"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b0d3c82e3d1c42e2cd0c","layer":"original","quote":"初，汉熹平五年〖8〗，黄龙现谯〖9〗。光禄大夫桥玄问太史令单飏〖10〗：“此何祥也〖11〗？”飏曰：“其国，后当有王者兴。不及五十年〖12〗，亦当复现。天事恒象〖13〗，此其应也。”内黄殷登默而记之。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ea1701bac033a55b3725","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ea1701bac033a55b3725","layer":"modern","quote":"〖8〗熹平五年：公元 176 年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1aa19f6feba4e668650c","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o004","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b0d3c82e3d1c42e2cd0c","layer":"original","quote":"初，汉熹平五年〖8〗，黄龙现谯〖9〗。光禄大夫桥玄问太史令单飏〖10〗：“此何祥也〖11〗？”飏曰：“其国，后当有王者兴。不及五十年〖12〗，亦当复现。天事恒象〖13〗，此其应也。”内黄殷登默而记之。至四十五年，登尚在。三月，黄龙现谯，登闻之曰：“单飏之言，其验兹乎！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o053","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1d30ef656dda0ab13df8","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，行幸广陵故城〖15〗，临江观兵〖16〗。戎卒十余万，旌旗数百里。﹝二﹞是岁，大寒，水道冰，舟不得入江；乃引还。十一月，东武阳王鉴薨。十二月，行自谯过梁〖17〗，遣使以太牢祀故汉太尉桥玄。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":465,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-be6ee1955b4d2400e13d","layer":"original","quote":"嵩生太祖。太祖少机警，有权数〖1〗。而任侠放荡〖2〗，不治行业〖3〗，故世人未之奇也〖4〗。﹝一﹞惟梁国桥玄、南阳何颙异焉〖5〗。玄谓太祖曰：“天下将乱，非命世之才不能济也〖6〗。能安之者，其在君乎！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o085b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a8b85fd0a011c49dc335","layer":"original","quote":"遂至浚仪〖11〗，治睢阳渠〖12〗；遣使以太牢祀桥玄〖13〗。﹝一﹞进军官渡。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":138,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p007a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b793036e493f3d88a501","layer":"pei","quote":"太尉桥玄，世名知人，睹太祖而异之，曰：‘吾见天下名士多矣，未有若君者也！君善自持。吾老矣！愿以妻子为托。’由是声名益重。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":10,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p009a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5b63615f895c633b2240","layer":"pei","quote":"光和中为太尉，以久病策罢。拜太中大夫。","attribution":"《汉纪》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":32,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p009b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5b63615f895c633b2240","layer":"pei","quote":"卒，家贫乏产业，柩无所殡。当世以此称为名臣。","attribution":"《汉纪》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":51,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p010a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d52f4a808aa2fd44a80c","layer":"pei","quote":"《世语》曰：“玄谓太祖曰：‘君未有名，可交许子将。’太祖乃造子将。子将纳焉，由是知名。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-6de9e09a3ba1d95f3972","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6de9e09a3ba1d95f3972","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗七年：建安七年（公元 202）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":464,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-225e544b9b47ac46c22e","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o002","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-be6ee1955b4d2400e13d","layer":"original","quote":"嵩生太祖。太祖少机警，有权数〖1〗。而任侠放荡〖2〗，不治行业〖3〗，故世人未之奇也〖4〗。﹝一﹞惟梁国桥玄、南阳何颙异焉〖5〗。玄谓太祖曰：“天下将乱，非命世之才不能济也〖6〗。能安之者，其在君乎！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o085","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a8b85fd0a011c49dc335","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月〖5〗，公军谯。令曰：“吾起义兵，为天下除暴乱。旧土人民〖6〗，死丧略尽〖7〗。国中终日行，不见所识〖8〗，使吾凄怆伤怀！其举义兵以来〖9〗，将士绝无后者，求其亲戚以后之〖10〗；授土田，官给耕牛；置学师以教之。为存者立庙，使祀其先人。魂而有灵，吾百年之后何恨哉！”遂至浚仪〖11〗，治睢阳渠〖12〗；遣使以太牢祀桥玄〖13〗。﹝一﹞进军官渡。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p007","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b793036e493f3d88a501","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“太尉桥玄，世名知人，睹太祖而异之，曰：‘吾见天下名士多矣，未有若君者也！君善自持。吾老矣！愿以妻子为托。’由是声名益重。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0a2e06f2b8303171e435","layer":"pei","quote":"《续汉书》曰：“玄字公祖。严明有才略，长于人物。”","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5b63615f895c633b2240","layer":"pei","quote":"张璠《汉纪》曰：“玄历位中外，以刚断称。谦俭下士，不以王爵私亲。光和中为太尉，以久病策罢。拜太中大夫。卒，家贫乏产业，柩无所殡。当世以此称为名臣。”","attribution":"《汉纪》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p010","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d52f4a808aa2fd44a80c","layer":"pei","quote":"《世语》曰：“玄谓太祖曰：‘君未有名，可交许子将。’太祖乃造子将。子将纳焉，由是知名。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b0db760310d0caa5fad","start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p026","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4deebbcde1ac1f9ea901","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《英雄记》曰：“瑁字元伟。玄族子。先为兖州刺史，甚有威惠。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e0e778cc8691b030ffc3","start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p064","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f96befa547fa37c887f2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《褒赏令》载公祀文曰：“故太尉桥公，诞敷明德，泛爱博容；国念明训，士思令谟。灵幽体翳，邈哉晞矣！吾以幼年，逮升堂室；特以顽鄙之姿，为大君子所纳；增荣益观，皆由奖助：犹仲尼称不如颜渊，李生之厚叹贾复。士死知己，怀此无忘。又承从容约誓之言：‘殂逝之后，路有经由，不以斗酒只鸡过相沃酹；车过三步，腹痛勿怪！’虽临时戏笑之言，非至亲之笃好，胡肯为此辞乎？匪谓灵忿，能贻己疾；怀旧惟顾，念之凄怆！奉命东征，屯次乡里；北望贵土，乃心陵墓。裁致薄奠，公其尚飨！”","attribution":"《褒赏令》所载曹操祭文","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":474,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1a299cfb0fa3b783d823","start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
